# Shared build context root for Dockerfile.multi-tenant and the tool-exec image
# (packages/tenant/container-docker/docker/Dockerfile).
#
# Every workspace member (vendor/, packages/, native/, apps/, website, examples/)
# stays in: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile resolves each one, so excluding any of
# them breaks the install. Only VCS metadata, installed dependencies, build
# output, and documentation leave the context.
.git
**/node_modules
**/lib
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.log
.agents
docs
.DS_Store
